  "title": "· New Bags · LOEWE Debuts Fall/Winter 2026 Collection: A Collaboration with German Artist Cosima von Bonin ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | LOEWE 上市2026秋冬系列作品：德国艺术家 Cosima von Bonin 合作设计",
  "excerpt": "Loewe's Fall/Winter 2026 collection, designed with artist Cosima von Bonin, features playful animal motifs and checks on bags and accessories.",
  "author": "撰稿 X LING 编辑 X VIVI",
  "date_iso": "2026-09-15",
  "date_label": "September 15, 2026",
  "cover_image": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/nws935b/174c4a7c59bf30cc.jpg",
