    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "LOEWE unveils its Fall/Winter 2026 collection this week, designed by co-creative directors Jack McCollough and Lazaro Hernandez in collaboration with German contemporary artist Cosima von Bonin. The artist's signature checks and playful animal motifs adorn bag linings, bag charms, costume jewelry, and more, injecting a spirit of experimentation and whimsy into the new season.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
