    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Born in Mombasa, Kenya, in 1962, Cosima von Bonin grew up in Austria and is now based in Cologne, Germany. Her practice spans sculpture, textiles, film, and performance art, and she is known for her oversized textile sculptures and irreverently humorous installations that touch on deep emotions and desires with a lighthearted, witty approach.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
