    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For Spring/Summer 2026, LOEWE introduces the new Amazona 180 bag, a contemporary reinterpretation of the house's classic Amazona, celebrating the brand's 180th anniversary. It retains the original's rectangular silhouette, square corners, and leather trim, while the single handle and open-top design lend a relaxed feel. The double-L logo marks the debut chapter for new co-creative directors Jack McCollough and Lazaro Hernandez.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This large bag is crafted from black water buffalo leather, with an open top revealing a bright yellow lining that creates a striking color contrast. The standout feature is a languid little rabbit draped over the rim—its long ears cleverly echo the lining color, and its soft, cute design adds a soothing touch. The rabbit is detachable, so you can also wear it as a bag charm; the playful idea is sure to bring a smile.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
